WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,590
Don't be afraid, he won't hurt you anymore

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:11,790
Dazhuang, sit down, okay, turn around, okay, lie down

3
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,220
who are you?

4
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:21,050
I am Ji Chuan, the leader of the Avengers Base in the Galaxy District.

5
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:24,050
Avengers is perfect for me.

6
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,050
That stronghold where Oligar Hotel was renovated

7
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,050
It’s just that I didn’t pay attention in my last life

8
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:29,050
In this life, I have experienced it

9
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:32,050
I'm sorry that my subordinates damaged your house.

10
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:34,050
He ran out before and I found him now

11
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:36,050
This won't happen again in the future

12
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,080
Now your villa is not safe

13
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:41,080
In order to apologize, can you come and live in our base?

14
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:44,080
Our base is safe and our supplies are abundant.
